  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7892d4635363dd5",
      "translationZh": "自 Anthropic 发布 Haiku 4.5 已过去约一年，随着 Sonnet、Opus 和 Fable 直至 5.5 的连续发布，它似乎有点被遗忘，尤其是 OpenAI 同时推出 Luna 6 以及 Astra 和 Sol 6 时。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc1cebd847029c89",
      "translationZh": "嗯，它已经发布，这是一个受欢迎的更新。更多内容见下文摘要。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e362b1423abba50",
      "translationZh": "AI News 适用于 10/06/2026-10/7/2026。我们检查了 12 个 subreddits、544 条 Twitters 和没有进一步的 Discords。AINews 的网站允许您搜索所有过去的期刊。提醒一下，AINews 现在是 Latent Space 的一个章节。您可以选择订阅或退订电子邮件频率！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b317d202ba8a3a6",
      "translationZh": "头条新闻：Anthropic 发布 Claude Haiku 5.5",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f02627addc2f5c8b",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 发布了 Claude Haiku 5.5，这是其在约一年后的首个 Haiku 级别更新。其定价旨在与 OpenAI 的 GPT-6 Luna 保持一致，Anthropic 还在同一天降低了 Sonnet 5.5 及其订阅计划的价格。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d75ca12ee3a4100",
      "translationZh": "预发布信号。@scaling01 在宣布之前发布了 “happy Haiku 5.5 day”。@kimmonismus 表示该模型已经在 Claude Code 更新中出现，并预测了 “Luna-pricing”。随后他在官方帖子之前发布了定价信息（ @kimmonismus ），并在上线时进行了确认（ @kimmonismus ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "309f4276d3a8f6cb",
      "translationZh": "官方发布。@claudeai 和 @AnthropicAI 称其为 “我们曾经发布过的最便宜、最快、最强大的小型模型”，运行成本平均比 Haiku 4.5 低约 75%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5b6a2ae69e1580f",
      "translationZh": "可用性及预期用途。它已在 Claude Platform 和 Claude Code（ @ClaudeDevs ）上线。Anthropic 将其定位为与 Opus 5.5 或 Sonnet 5.5 配对的副代理，用于高容量、对成本敏感的工作，如摘要、压缩和数据库查询。@mikeyk 将这种分工描述为 “Opus 负责深度思考，Haiku 负责高容量工作”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f05b026e49663655",
      "translationZh": "分层定价 ( @ClaudeDevs ):",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf70928231ff639a",
      "translationZh": "提示词长度提示词输入/输出（每100万token）每100万token的缓存读取量低于10万token 0.10 / 0.50 0.01超过10万token 0.50 / 2.50 0.05",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88eb49a7e2b1b793",
      "translationZh": "Sonnet 5.5 降价。缓存读取费用从每 100 万 token 的 0.20 美元减半至 0.10 美元。Anthropic 表示，这使得 Sonnet 5.5 在大多数长时间运行或智能体任务中的成本降低了约 20%（ @claudeai ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d1d4804f485e334",
      "translationZh": "订阅者的 API 额度。每月 Claude Platform API 额度现在包含 Max 5x (100)、Max 20x (200) 以及 Team（最高 500，池化使用）。这些额度适用于任何模型，包括 Haiku 5.5，并可在第三方工具中使用 (@ClaudeDevs)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4e791549eae21b2",
      "translationZh": "同日发布的 SDK 更新。Computer-use（计算机使用）和 browser-use（浏览器使用）工具集现已内置于 Python 和 TypeScript 版 Claude SDK 中。该 SDK 会运行动作循环（action loop），并将点击和按键指令发送给来自 browser_use、Browserbase、E2B 或 Daytona 的驱动程序，因此开发者无需再自行编写该循环（@ClaudeDevs，快速入门）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "769fc75027775ac4",
      "translationZh": "合作伙伴在第一天的推广：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d81c5bb3d620765a",
      "translationZh": "Cursor：@cursor_ai 声称在较短请求上的表现“比 Haiku 4.5 低 10 倍”，并发布了 CursorBench 的对比结果（ @cursor_ai ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f38a3c6b57053c1",
      "translationZh": "VS Code 中的 GitHub Copilot：@code 报告称其“在许多编程任务中达到了与 Claude Sonnet 5 相当的效果，同时使用了更少的 token 和步骤”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "733e3f2e15ee6002",
      "translationZh": "Devin：@cognition 报告在 FrontierCode 1.1 上达到 58.4%，领先于 Sonnet 5，每任务成本大约只有八分之一，并建议将其作为 Opus 5.5 领导下的 Fusion 中的“sidekick”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e16d44c15a1c8e6",
      "translationZh": "Arena：已加入 Agent Arena、Code Arena WebDev、Text、Document 和 Vision，得分待定（ @arena ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43e575cb5a5cf29d",
      "translationZh": "OpenDocRouter：当天已添加（详见下文）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "28a666a73cc13cce",
      "translationZh": "独立评估：Artificial Analysis",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "750de7a2f00ac4b9",
      "translationZh": "@ArtificialAnlys 发布了最详细的第三方数据（ per-eval breakdown , comparison page ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29e12b83e1114275",
      "translationZh": "Intelligence Index: 43 在最大努力下，比之前的 Haiku 高 26 分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a31618255bd026f9",
      "translationZh": "略微领先于 GLM-5.3 Flash（42）、Gemini 3.8 Flash（41）和 GPT-6 Luna（38）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f553a63351c35603",
      "translationZh": "与 Kimi K3（44）相当，是一个 2.8T-parameter open-weights 模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1b55e6e2002d7a2",
      "translationZh": "落后于 Claude Sonnet 5.5 在最大努力 (56) 下 13 分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "adb92dd9ed4e4311",
      "translationZh": "新控件。这是首款具备 Anthropic 的努力设置和自适应思考的 Haiku。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c28d396cd3cece3c",
      "translationZh": "令牌使用量是主要的注意事项。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd8f45565283a583",
      "translationZh": "在最大努力下，每个 Index 任务大约使用 162k 输出令牌，大约是 GPT-6 Luna 在最大努力下 (~50k) 的 3 倍。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43b6d0a77f60309a",
      "translationZh": "从 xhigh 提升到 max 会增加 2 分，大约需要 1.8 倍的令牌。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57fac4c34b64fdc8",
      "translationZh": "在得分相同的情况下，它仍然更冗长：Haiku 5.5 在高努力下得分 38，使用约 55k 令牌；而 Luna 在最大努力下得分 38，使用约 50k 令牌。在较低努力设置下，差距会进一步扩大。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d52698909868f86",
      "translationZh": "成本数字是临时的。人工分析目前尚未对超过 100K 令牌的 5 倍价格阶梯进行建模。每任务成本数字将随后给出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5eb7cbcca044a5a1",
      "translationZh": "AA-Briefcase（私有代理知识工作评估）：1578 Elo。它领先于 Kimi K3 和 GLM-5.3，并且与 Muse Spark 1.3 在最大努力下相当。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2edc66967cc2132",
      "translationZh": "Terminal-Bench 4.0: 33% ， 相比 Haiku 4.5 的 0% 提升。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5f3ec9a5d3047d0",
      "translationZh": "与 GLM-5.3 Flash 持平。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e822f2e342f97f3e",
      "translationZh": "领先于 Gemini 3.8 Flash（20%）和 GPT-6 Luna（13%）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c0fa53fa519be61",
      "translationZh": "知识与幻觉（AA-Omniscience）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9c369db1393126c",
      "translationZh": "模型准确率 幻觉率 Haiku 5.536% 40% Gemini 3.8 Flash 55% 55% GPT-6 Luna 44% 77%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a6374796477a85e",
      "translationZh": "Haiku 较低准确率的部分原因是它更愿意说不知道。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97a8219eec9358ad",
      "translationZh": "AutomationBench-AA: 35% ， 相比 Luna、Gemini 3.8 Flash 和 GLM-5.3 Flash 的 53–60%。一个预发布安全错误导致模型过度拒绝。Anthropic 正在修复此问题，人工智能分析将重新运行评估，并期望得分提升。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b51d2002ecb9e270",
      "translationZh": "1M-token 上下文，相比 Haiku 4.5 的 200k 提升。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "657529b0d93f558b",
      "translationZh": "文本和图像输入，文本输出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31a11f96ee49b1d4",
      "translationZh": "5 分钟的缓存写入每 1M tokens 花费 0.125（超过 100K 时为 0.625）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2c731e99e111cdd2",
      "translationZh": "其他基准声明（主要来自供应商或二手信息）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "012c009e7ab48ca9",
      "translationZh": "@ShayneRedford 汇总了 Anthropic 报告的跃升：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da4b843381898ea7",
      "translationZh": "OSWorld（计算机使用）：15% → 72%.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e81640898794394",
      "translationZh": "TerminalBench：0% → 39%。这与 Artificial Analysis 在 Terminal-Bench 4.0 上的独立 33% 不同。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f11cedadf228825",
      "translationZh": "知识工作和推理方面的提升为 10–50%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d5f2bf8a5b02f2b",
      "translationZh": "在这些方面，它在大多数情况下胜过 Luna。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8b8c5236e10dfec",
      "translationZh": "1M 上下文，最大输出约为 12k tokens。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d21fa7ed4e3f9571",
      "translationZh": "@alexalbert__ (Anthropic) 强调 Haiku 4.5 于 2025 年 10 月 15 日发布，因此比较跨度不到一年。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
