      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5343983517e2d745",
      "translationZh": "@LoganMarkewich：总体上接近 Luna，在表格上略好，图表理解方面稍弱。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d85ea6ff20dbccb",
      "translationZh": "@jerryjliu0：大约每 1,000 页 1.2。在价格方面，表格和阅读顺序表现良好；在图表、语义格式和边界框方面较弱。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcf1a21e04cbcfe5",
      "translationZh": "@simonw 撰写了定价说明并运行了他的 pelican-on-a-bicycle 测试。他表示它比 Haiku 4.5 好得多，而 Haiku 4.5 的成本是其 10 倍（比较）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
