    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71e5d7fe242a5dc3",
      "translationZh": "大量令牌使用（在最大努力下约为 Luna 的 3 倍）抵消了部分每令牌折扣。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3fd1b4b59c17edb",
      "translationZh": "超过 100K 令牌的提示需要支付 5 倍的费用，这对长上下文代理循环很重要。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b793db57de31e804",
      "translationZh": "这两种效应可能解释了为什么 Cursor 的 “短请求下便宜 10 倍” 与 Anthropic 的 “平均便宜 75%” 有所不同。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cefe6ce5c4c0ec65",
      "translationZh": "事实回忆的表现弱于 Gemini 3.8 Flash 和 Luna。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3224f91965ba2b79",
      "translationZh": "过度拒绝错误当前正在压低自动化得分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "314a185422ac413c",
      "translationZh": "尚未进行基准测试：Arena 分数待定，独立的 cost-per-task 数据等待分层定价支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "613bde1c65d45ee3",
      "translationZh": "Haiku 4.5 自 2025 年 10 月起一直是 Anthropic 的小型模型。此后，OpenAI 的 GPT-6 Luna、Gemini 3.8 Flash、GLM-5.3 Flash 和 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 在低端成本市场上展开竞争。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d96c53b9002f3b72",
      "translationZh": "Haiku 5.5 的贴纸价格与 Luna 完全相同。它增加了 effort control 和 1M 上下文。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf0887a8c4bd0f33",
      "translationZh": "它被明确定位为多模型代理 harness 内的廉价工作器：Claude Code subagents、Devin Fusion、Copilot subagents，以及压缩或摘要步骤。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69dddfd65ccf08e2",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 将其与 Sonnet cache-read 削减和 subscription API 积分配合，形成对 agent economics 的协调推动。该推动正值关于 token 费用的更广泛辩论之中（见 @theo 下方）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
